  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3FM SR 2019: Human Trafficking Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide youth returnees in North Wollo selected woreda access to assistance and services (relief, livelihood, psychosocial, health care and protection services );
Provide potential youth migrants and communities in North Wollo selected woreda with increased social cohesion and better understanding of migration related risks leading to reduced stigma among youth migrants and returnees and improved reintegration;
Improving the capacity of ERCS to manage migration projects and carry out  humanitarian diplomacy (evidence based advocacy)</narrative>
  </description>
